      <h1>KnowSelf: Teaching LLM Agents When to Think, Reflect, or Seek Knowledge</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Agentic knowledgeable self-awareness: a framework that lets LLM agents adaptively choose fast execution, reflective correction, or external knowledge retrieval based on task situation.</p>
