          <div class="num">1</div>
          <h3>Heuristic Situation Judgment</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Self-explore trajectories on ALFWorld tasks.</li>
            <li>Label states as fast / slow / knowledgeable situations.</li>
            <li>Insert special cognitive-routing tokens into traces.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">2</div>
          <h3>Two-Stage Optimization</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Stage I: supervised fine-tuning on token-augmented traces.</li>
            <li>Stage II: RPO to reinforce decision quality and task success.</li>
            <li>No costly human dense annotations required.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">3</div>
          <h3>Self-Aware Inference</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Model emits situational token online at each step.</li>
            <li>Token gates direct action, reflection, or retrieval module.</li>
            <li>Achieves selective knowledge usage with higher final returns.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
